<!--
  Fixture provenance (guardrail 3: real-but-public government data).
  Source: U.S. National Park Service (NPS) unit boundaries, KML, via data.gov.
  Dataset: "National Park Boundaries" (catalog.data.gov/dataset/national-park-boundaries).
  Direct KMZ: http://gstore.unm.edu/apps/rgisarchive/datasets/7bbe8af5-029b-4adf-b06c-134f0dd57226/nps_boundary.derived.kml
